      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "When the Erie Railroad’s shortcut line reached Mountainville in 1871, the hamlet shifted from a rural outpost to a bustling trading hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
